  "headline": "Clients group by when they were called, not by whether they subscribed.",
  "body": "HDBSCAN finds 26 dense groups. Their subscription rates range from 3.0% to 74.1%, so the groups do carry some signal (cluster-rate AUC 0.793 on held-out clients), but the partition matches month (AMI 0.63) far better than subscription (AMI 0.042). The largest group (5,360 clients) — month=may (99% vs 33% overall); contact=telephone (100% vs 37% overall); cons.conf.idx high (mean -36.45 vs -40.5). Subscription 3.8% — low response.",
